# ZENVEXA Digital Agency — Optional Environment Configuration
# No environment variables are required for this website to build or run.
# By default, the Contact Form validates inquiries and delivers them via WhatsApp or Email.

# Optional: Uncomment and add your Web3Forms public access key (https://web3forms.com)
# when you are ready to enable direct-to-inbox form submissions.
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Optional: Uncomment and add a custom webhook or Formspree endpoint URL if preferred.
# VITE_CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
